Z||000000||Denny||09-10-2001||08:11 PM||||Do any of you experts out there in FieroLand know if Pontiac installed something like fishing line behind the GT sail panels to aid in the removal?  I found something like about 30# fishing line hanging from both sail panels this evening.  It was hanging loose only at the bottom, but was tucked in around the entire periphery of both panels.<BR><P>------------------<BR>Denny Lambert<BR>Custom 1986 SE<BR>Stock 1986 GT<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/SEGTfront.jpg"> ||||reg||5
Z||000001||Denny||09-10-2001||09:03 PM||||The overwhelming consensus from my friends, and from the mailing lists, is "yes, it's supposed to be there."<P>So now we know.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Denny Lambert<BR>Custom 1986 SE<BR>Stock 1986 GT<p>[This message has been edited by Denny (edited 09-11-2001).]||||reg||4
Z||000002||Fierowrecker||09-10-2001||09:05 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Denny:<BR><B>Do any of you experts out there in FieroLand know if Pontiac installed something like fishing line behind the GT sail panels to aid in the removal?  I found something like about 30# fishing line hanging from both sail panels this evening.  It was hanging loose only at the bottom, but was tucked in around the entire periphery of both panels.<P><BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hate to say it, but it sounds like some thing fishy...<BR>I have never found any fish line behind my sail panels, and I have replaced 3...<BR>Maybe someone else needed a set, and almost got yours???<P><P>------------------<BR>crash... The Fierowrecker<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://fiero.nl/uploads/crash_sig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000003||rockcrawl||09-10-2001||09:18 PM||||Nah, nothing fishy about that. I've seen it on a few GTs and it was also on the new GM quarter window I had. It doesn't doo much good though, on a 15 year old car it just rips when you try to use it to get the window out.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Standard||09-10-2001||10:12 PM||||Yeah, it was supposed to be there to help cut the tape that holds the sail panels.||||reg||1
